      "plain": "Arc Kills and Kinetic Kills charge up an Ionic Sentry. Readies at 6 Charges.\nWeapon = 1 [2] | Abilities = 2 [?]\n\nReplaces Grenade with an Ionic Sentry.\nCounts as an Arc Grenade Ability Damage, and will trigger Grenade Ability interactions.\n\nIonic Sentry:\nInflicts Blind for 10? [3?] seconds to enemies within 5 meters upon landing\nAutomatically shoots a chaining bolt of lightning every second at enemies within 16 metres, dealing 202 [50] Arc Damage. \nChains towards an additional enemy within 6 meters of the initially struck target.\nGrants x1 Bolt Charge on hit.\nLasts for 15 seconds and has ? Construct HP.\nUser is immune to self-blind.\n\nIncurs a 6 second cooldown after activating. Kills while on cooldown don't give charges.",
